{{Item|Undead Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in the [[Catacombs]].

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Undead Essence}} can be be obtained in the {{Zone|dungeon hub}} and the [[Catacombs]] in multiple ways:
* [[Dungeon Reward Chest]]s
* [[Salvaging#Undead|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Undead Essence}}.
